---
title: "cancel (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: project admin cancels auction
    q_check_caller --> q_check_not_locked: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_locked --> q_check_not_canceled: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_not_locked --> q_revert_locked: cancellation locked after initializePublishSaleResults
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_cancel: sale not already canceled
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: already canceled
    q_cancel --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled()
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert CancellationLocked
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled

    note right of q_check_not_locked
        INV-001: Cancellation impossible after initializePublishSaleResults locks it
        INV-002: Window for cancellation: from initialization until refund period ends
    end note
